sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor O as Office Staff
participant UI as OfficeScreens
participant DMS as DeliveryManagementSystem
participant DR as DeliveryRegistry
participant SR as StaffRoster
participant R as r:DeliveryRequest
O->>UI: 3 Allocate delivery staff
UI->>DMS: awaitingAllocation()
DMS->>DR: withStatus(ACCEPTED)
DR-->>UI: [r]
UI->>DMS: availableStaffFor(r.id)
DMS->>R: committedPeriod()
DMS->>SR: availableStaff(start, end)
loop each active driver
  SR->>SR: covered by a StaffAvailability?
  SR->>DR: commitmentsFor(driver) - any overlap?
end
SR-->>UI: [Dana]
O->>UI: Driver ID U-0004 (Dev)
UI->>DMS: allocate(r.id, U-0004)
DMS->>SR: isFree(U-0004, start, end)
SR-->>DMS: false
DMS-->>UI: StateError "no longer available"
O->>UI: Driver ID U-0003 (Dana)
UI->>DMS: allocate(r.id, U-0003)
DMS->>SR: isFree(U-0003, start, end)
SR-->>DMS: true
DMS->>R: allocate(U-0003, now, office, "Dana Driver")
R->>R: ACCEPTED -> ALLOCATED, append StatusChange
DMS->>DMS: save()
